<title>USA: Avigen names Paulson CFO.</title>
<headline>Avigen names Paulson CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avigen Inc said Thursday it has named Thomas Paulson as its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The company did not say who he replaces, and officials were unavailable to comment.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Avigen, Mr. Paulson was president of Paulson Associates, a biotechnology consulting firm where Avigen has been a client for the past two years.</p>
<p>Avigen launched its initial public offering of common stock in May this year.</p>
